            "review_title": "Review at Chef Mamma's",
            "review_text": "Paula\nBrisbane, Australia43 contributions\n0\nClose by but disappointing\nApr 2026 • Couples\nNot our usual to eat Italian in Vietnam, just it was close to our airport hotel. My pesto penne had no flavour, basil or Parmesan. My partner’s pizza didn’t have the promised pepperoni and was bland with no herbs and on a sub standard base. The first 3 beers we ordered weren’t available, including the promised draught. No local beers, 95k for a Czech beer!\nRead more\nWritten April 20, 2026",
