            "review_title": "Review at Chef Mamma's",
            "review_text": "Doris D\nLatina, Italy52 contributions\n0\nLots of Italy in Vietnamese Sauce\nJan 2019 • Friends\nChef Mamma's is a busy, busy, unpretentious spot, within a mall context. Musically vibrating with the exuberant chatty voices of the lunch crowd, this a very popular spot with the locals.\nThe menu offers a wide variety of true Italian favorites such as spaghetti carbonara, linguine with seafood, penne all'arrabbiata, lasagna and a selction of risottos.\n\nAttentive also to the mixed local audience, the restaurant offers a rich menu of Vietnamese and other Asian specialities.\n\nA very pleasant experience with a rather good attempt at Italian specialties, enjoyable with the tropical twist of coconut juice!\n\nRecommended!\nRead more\nWritten January 24, 2019",
